==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*10 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 20 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for easier stages to become available and clearing those first.

Similarly, you are expected to have all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] by now, or close to all.

Much like [[Sahara (Aku Realm)|Sahara]], this stage features Fallen Bear, but also not much more that can be a threat. None of the Aliens are pushers, while Calamary is guaranteed to fall from occasional wave attacks, courtesy of [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]]. It is therefore recommended to not focus your army on the Aliens, especially do not bring [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], for his stats, without + levels, are not worth half his cost.

